// Maps stable game opcode identifiers to RoF2 wire opcodes.
// The server configuration supplies the wire values in opcodes.inc; a
// zero/missing wire value never becomes a mapping. Scope is explicit to keep
// independent world/zone reverse maps (and preserve alias collisions).
// Every mapping is a *name*, not a claim that encode/decode is implemented.
